table, project_makefiles/platform/platforms.mk (plan Step 0.4), and generalises the Linux
bootstrap hand-off in src/Makefile from linux_aarch64 to any Linux target. Two other
agents were building in this tree when it was written, so it is a patch file, not an edit.
Apply from the repository root with:   git apply --check project_makefiles/platform/platforms.patch
Then delete the same inline macOS lines from the other 42 trial makefiles that trials/base/makefile
shows here (the list is in trials/platform/apple_silicon_mac.mk).

